OL,3,ABurnham wants Neets report to be
OL,4,Awatershed moment, No 10 says, as Tories
OL,5,Acriticise welfare and tax proposals
OL,6,
OL,7,FPM Andy Burnham wants a review into UK
OL,8,Fyouth unemployment to be a "watershed
OL,9,Fmoment in how we think about welfare
OL,10,Fand how we support young people", No 10
OL,11,Fsays
OL,13,FThe review, by former minister Alan
OL,14,FMilburn, proposes widespread changes to
OL,15,Ftax, welfare and education to help get
OL,16,F440,000 young people into work by 2036
OL,17,F- here are some other key figures
OL,19,FMilburn suggests businesses should be
OL,20,Ftaxed less for employing young people,
OL,21,Fand the number of apprenticeships
OL,22,Fshould double
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
